DTSTART:20260922
DTEND:20270531
SUMMARY:Interchange Message: CANADA WATER STATION: Until Spring 2027\, no 
 step-free access between street and ticket hall level at this station. 
 This is while we carry out lift replacement work. For step-free access to 
 the Jubilee line\, take bus 47 or 188 from stop B1 in the bus station to 
 Bermondsey. For step-free access to the Windrush line\, take any bus from 
 stop B2\, or bus 1 or 381 from stop C in the bus station to Surrey Quays. 
 Alternatively\, it is about an 800m journey to Surrey Quays at street 
 level via Deal Porters Way. You will not be able to use the lift between 
 the street and ticket hall to enter the station. Please plan ahead and 
 allow more time for your journey
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
