SUMMARY:Part Closure: JUBILEE LINE: From 0430 Saturday 3 until 0130 Sunday 
 4 October\, no service between Green Park and Canary Wharf. If travelling 
 between Central London and North Greenwich\, please travel via Stratford.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261003T100206Z
UID:7caeeeda-bf11-11f1-9774-6045bd057500
DTSTART:20261003
DTEND:20261005
SUMMARY:Closure: CANADA WATER STATION: From 0130 Saturday 3 October\, and 
 all day Sunday 4 October\, the station is closed. Please use Surrey Quays 
 station instead. Replacement bus service M operates between Canada Water 
 and Clapham Junction via Surrey Quays on Sunday only.
END:VEVENT
